    ⟨hk, hp, hd, K, fK, finK, card, marking, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5⟩ | ⟨hk, -⟩ |
    ⟨-, exponent, K, fK, finK, charK, scope, ⟨hk, -⟩ | ⟨hk, -⟩⟩
